# The repo is LF. Editor tooling on Windows was rewriting docs to CRLF, which with
# core.autocrlf=false produced whole-file diffs that buried the real edit: P95's
# retraction was 6 lines and showed as 250. Normalise at the boundary so the class
# of bug cannot recur silently.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py  text diff=python
